abstract: >-
  Research software for schema-first, human-in-the-loop stock drawdown-risk
  analysis with temporal validation, calibration, uncertainty, trust scores,
  warning explanations. Version 0.3.2 is a maintenance and security release
  of the reproducible open-source pilot, not externally validated research or
  investment advice.
